# Seeded with the Lamplight fixture. A turn whose autosave the reader cannot
# store says so, and the story page still fits under the message.
wait-for Lamplight
tap Lamplight
wait-for light.
scenario storage-full
tap North
wait-for The save could not be written. Check free space.
expect Gravel crunches
clean
shot savefail-banner
scenario normal
tap South
# A room already seen is named without its description.
wait-for Lamp Square
expect-missing The save could not be written.
